OFF THE RECORD: Tests use units of three degrees and cover cardinal
OFF THE RECORD: values, periodicity, a negative angle, and the
OFF THE RECORD: Pythagorean identity at the table's three-decimal
OFF THE RECORD: precision.

ARTICLE 1.
    LET IT BE RECORDED THAT table IS THE FINDING OF the-table-of-sines.
    PROCLAIM THE LENGTH OF table.
    PROCLAIM THE FINDING OF sine REGARDING 0 AND table.
    PROCLAIM THE FINDING OF sine REGARDING 10 AND table.
    PROCLAIM THE FINDING OF sine REGARDING 15 AND table.
    PROCLAIM THE FINDING OF sine REGARDING 30 AND table.
    PROCLAIM THE FINDING OF sine REGARDING 90 AND table.
    PROCLAIM THE FINDING OF cosine REGARDING 0 AND table.
    PROCLAIM THE FINDING OF cosine REGARDING 40 AND table.
    PROCLAIM THE FINDING OF sine REGARDING 150 AND table.
    PROCLAIM THE FINDING OF sine REGARDING -30 AND table.
    LET IT BE RECORDED THAT s IS THE FINDING OF sine REGARDING 7 AND table.
    LET IT BE RECORDED THAT c IS THE FINDING OF cosine REGARDING 7 AND table.
    PROCLAIM "the identity holds, officially: " PLUS THE TRANSCRIPT OF (s TIMES s PLUS c TIMES c).
    ADJOURN INDEFINITELY.
